er":null,"call_locator":"fee180acfe53e25f3e7db7481a01447487dcf61462607e47ef16efb9e47ead84","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"2680483adec2b9b1574bab0946fc6df91ee35bea2c59e13d8958976b2c6ab0bb","logical_entry_identity":"a8536c45bd78e4dbdef30db2acded042d54ebb6a248575da2a8a26e4cc85ff1d","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Assault nearby foes with 4 fast attacks for %d%% (at 0 Hate) to %d%% (at 100+ Hate) damage each. Stalked prey are always targeted if nearby.\n\t\tAt level 3 the intensity of your assault overwhelms anyone who is struck, reducing their Defense by %d for 4 turns.\n\t\tThe damage multiplier and Defense reduction increase with your Strength.\n\n\t\tThis talent will also attack with your shield, if you have one equipped.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"对附近目标发动 4 次快速攻击，每次造成 %d%%（0 仇恨值时）至 %d%%（100+ 仇恨值时）伤害。若附近有被追踪的猎物，则总是攻击它。\n\t\t等级 3 时，猛烈攻击会压倒每个被命中的目标，使其闪避降低 %d，持续 4 回合。\n\t\t伤害倍率和闪避减值受力量值加成。\n\n\t\t如果你装备了盾牌，这一技能也会用你的盾牌攻击。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"97849a25d01b56b3ca941a5f080ec73a003b18af0c50d99b0499fac4dba4dc67","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5716e70d1849ea122b6e7fbcff8c4da72ef1b4d65e61dd1af360f3caf6976b56","logical_entry_identity":"feed9e04023c57db601e048e6b634dca06c3342da7dc014f895d7457e987c190","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You focus your senses, getting information from moments in the future.\n\t\tImproves your capacity to see invisible foes by +%d, to see through stealth by +%d, and to perform a critical spell cast by +%d%%.\n\t\tThe effects will improve with your Spellpower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你集中感官，从未来的片刻中获取信息。\n\t\t侦测隐形等级提高 +%d，侦测潜行等级提高 +%d，法术暴击几率提高 +%d%%。\n\t\t此效果受法术强度加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"27254f693a6d25575ca97e93b658277094aaba198ec186c38838de88877fed4c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"cc4f6b38ef196ffc893387e0fa25df47d658984e4d860817bfadfe1edd4cc745","logical_entry_identity":"081714dbc4b8ab7b55f8fc4e081f8b612448f060cddd2a4362a4767d44a6da86","no