ce focuses its mind-piercing eye on #Target#!","source_tag":"logCombat","target":"扭曲之刃·圣灵之眼将它穿透灵魂的目光集中在了 #Target# 上！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a52db6a1b47dc02ea43c2a8cdd6467e2f07db56e57f4790fb641db73e346203f","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"fb4d082b8b5f3eba3a724f6aad1dcded8d797301a3201c520eb7f4c2723a0922","logical_entry_identity":"b98399d1127755878cd9b8fc15da1fe7f62fae94dc435bd98b511b50d273b103","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Was teleported into Caldizar's Fortress, far into the void between the stars.","source_tag":"_t","target":"传送进凯尔帝勒的堡垒，群星中的虚空地带。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e6ec01f849b54a8869da270d4ab119e722b0e6c396833f777968fe3a1db68ef3","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"fb4d7c58ce50119512977d603554bd4430ce3049493b91c67dfde5d3e0b5938d","logical_entry_identity":"fc38426780fc63e440f9165ed4a12c5917387ed36e271d2bf15b12b4a2905441","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#LIGHT_STEEL_BLUE##Source# resists the pull of #Target#!","source_tag":"logCombat","target":"#LIGHT_STEEL_BLUE##Source#抵抗了#Target#的拉力！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"50a5bbbdbb42313e3200eaa389c5e414d06cd6c420f1506ef71ed90d74cd0e8b","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"fb5285712df46393384e836660e68164b5d7caff46bf9f76f5d676cf98b9eeec","logical_entry_identity":"953e16ec882cfd8ac897621b015ec1986da2857306076104e1c4939062bee439","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"dwarven-steel dagger","source_tag":"entity name","target":"矮人钢匕首"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"66579c381e6048e4d984408b6397cca9f6cfe0ee02c3fbcd1a22a7d86add1cd5","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"fb547b17500e1d376d83eb06e7c9ca7ea6be729bf37dac8f3f3f66bc93c7ce47","logical_entry_identity":"3865017ca563429fb9306939a00961ea2eb4796bf78117437695002562278e06","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Rushes forward and attempts to take the target to the ground, making a melee attack for %d%% damage then attempting to grapple them. If you're already grappling the target you'll instead slam them into the ground creating a radius 5 shockwave for %d physical damage and breaking your grapple.\n\t\tThe grapple effects and duration will be based off your grapple talent, if you have it, and the damage will scale with your Physical Power.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"冲向目标，试图将其扑倒在地，进行一次近战攻击造成 %d%% 伤害，然后尝试抓取。如果已在抓取状态，则将目标猛砸向地面，制造冲击波，在半径 5 的范围内造成 %d 物理伤害并解除抓取。\n\t\t抓取效果和持续时间取决于你的抓取技能（若已习得），伤害受物理强度加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c28efe692ab64995e192d472d868f64a0f8d8463ca020a3f45c5f6dbbc15565e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"fb578924d2f1acd3cb0bc55264c0919c631f8e29311779ef47d145ebca177b9d","logical_entry_identity":"08ed3ed3e9ad65218b2765f251e70c1b3b7b4566239c4e7e74e5adb77758b632","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"New Class: #LIGHT_GREEN#Wyrmic (Wilder)","source_tag":"_t","target":"新职业：#LIGHT_GREEN#龙战士（野性系）"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"fd2410cfe114dbc99f1040974ad7eaa898cacc71d4282e7c0d20960689f2bf8f","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"fb582671c569b0789882d7674c13f73c5654c15a1a61d9d957caa0b271f43ff4","logical_entry_identity":"4c84a12600623fc43c8ca4231ca169c42f05a162879c5a08969de31cf97d25a4","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Mark Prey","source_tag":"talent name","target":"猎杀标记"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f85501b109be79940892d11d28f7b759cdca1f531db9fbe91df3e07b20312bd3","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"fb5d4f4897c879ba98bf54cfef9de376d208643ca5083ee2bd2922d9263bfb87","logical_entry_identity":"5facdd1ef9ac113d0b879eebc0996e0e2dcc74a10a7078dcd1e004386c9491c8","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Blur Sight","source_tag":"talent name","target":"模糊视觉"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6f447b3bcd1e28ef37711d935d426495724eac1dccac9d5abb092324561e6c5e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"fb643ca9df6b45f4d8fccf7748e6c66d889cd668fcccb030929706f2d2c55766","logical_entry_identity":"f20039baa7b11f16d809da668a9b6cd093e03fb499fb99c997580381b70e75f3","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#{italic}#'But AMAKTHEL came, and his might surpassed all else, and the petty gods fled before his glory. And he made the Sun from his breath and held it above the world and said, \"All that this light touches shall be mine, and this light shall touch all the world.'#{normal}#","source_tag":"_t","target":"#{italic}#但阿马克泰尔来了，他的勇武震慑了众人，伪神们慑服于他的荣耀。他深呼吸后把太阳高举到了世界之上，说：“阳光所至，即我所至，这光芒将照亮全世界。”#{normal}#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f6740bfb93b8d45a0ea0b5e975f50ae6a269b5f74316b1560c95fa9946d2a35e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"fb6873f42c7d3ddf8a5a39cae69cd50de45c7b6c8234994050b8ba12a59d5066","logical_entry_identity":"7839362d52ac86a727f484eeb5c6a65553aa9224610f9d95b38f81ed90f75aa2","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Merchant Caravan","source_tag":"faction name","target":"商队"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1fbd2b28aaf964a5e1b253772cedf14adffff87ef105bee6dad1f051fd0f0349","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"fb69a24258edd1d82c998c83944d9145f2e7a85f85d2882c4f6bac2bd814c252","logical_entry_identity":"b1e87733533140fecd5da00cf6e7a1f430e0703a4413ad6d7154b374fd4aab5c","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Improve your predation by learning from past hunts. You gain %0.2f accuracy and %0.2f armor penetration against foes for each foe of that type you have previously slain, to a maximum of %d accuracy and %d apr.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你从过去的杀戮中汲取知识，强化你猎杀的能力。你过去每杀死过该类型的一个生物，就获得 %0.2f 命中和 %0.2f 护甲穿透，最多 %d 命中和 %d 护甲穿透。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"0f0bed09ddcbbc28aee9e96e640698a624d268b9d284b8918d9e0957ccf9a075","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"fb6bb78c125832b2f005944a3b145fa298cd09e655c30bc509158b3e0ae51e51","logical_entry_identity":"8d46543eaa34287052ea932e633f2f02be512c7a0d7d5153ecef67567a3b48a9","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The target's light, darkness, and fire resistance has been increased by %d%%.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"目标的光系、暗影和火焰伤害抗性增加 %d%%。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"686174c63731133f20ac2041f0fc08498c6d0a9da8d1a9b453210c65d809e5f2","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"fb7000c6d11e2b3d3747ce23d7d6d12b16e11ca487b4db51af0fd1635f4f5626","logical_entry_identity":"cd695fa27922a4e181ae10b986f2ee77059037d40cebf464bd95fdfacd8fa273","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"This mass of fused molten bone from the Heavy Sentinel radiates intense power. It still glows red with the heat of the Sentinel's core, and yet seems to do you no harm.","source_tag":"_t","target":"这团来自重型哨兵的融合熔融骨骼散发着强大的力量。它仍因哨兵核心的热量而发红发亮，不过似乎不会伤害到你。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"3b5582a3d9909bb22defe41ad8cefb1ab81ca0f95d13af3fbdf8463cc40d03bb","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"fb741fef80fc241b2e9baf56e001ec2e84b2feeefe6c488e744ecae32a6f01f7","logical_entry_identity":"f1c434e7411526f946fa16af54f8503418807548056806f1d38839bf15e0caae","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"This voratun shield, coated with thick vines, was imbued with nature's power long ago by the Halfling General Almadar Riul, who used it to stave off the magic and diseases of orcish corruptors during the peak of the Pyre Wars.","source_tag":"_t","target":"这块表面缠绕着厚实藤蔓的沃瑞钽盾牌，许多年前由半身人将军阿尔曼达·鲁伊尔注入了自然之力。在烈火战争最激烈的时期，他用它抵挡兽人堕落者的魔法与疾病。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"551adbdeede6394485e65eb2ded27fb13217c10bc471aec5ac38254e52a5984d","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"fb742fe48686550500fd3540445f66222a487f4878defccb2c914e9d9fe0fca8","logical_entry_identity":"1c4a829da59c36c80c7abfd148f8cd7a05072fa808708d727d8766510fb236f2","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Disciplined Aura","source_tag":"_t","target":"纪律光环"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a6a6ab02994947bba608f6b8ca89f540c009cfa24ec88db701027f31e9b20eff","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"fb7d58764cd8d18162f4cf0c3c510a64f15410e8f5fa1f0245d5bdf17ef51313","logical_entry_identity":"48770bc7b985afc5d3d67a49f67b5ba59c748484d1827212fd3df9b54bc39a25","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Give me an hour or so to make with the alchemy. Don't go anywhere.","source_tag":"_t","target":"别走开，给我一个小时的时间去做药剂。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"bdb0519be06b294ddbdec223b33bf7bace22d6587abe6f6a5826717564392291","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"fb7eb2381eed1b7bb7c4d981f68fd3522e48ec5d27488fa03ea7380596424128","logical_entry_identity":"af60be14a4049bedc801d6ca0e7ed2f6cece6892573d417af6b6fc2aeb22941e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"+Gather the Threads","source_tag":"_t","target":"+聚拢时间线"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"58fd41b4cc0fc119737a69d26a9edc92b69db72d7edae265d31fd93bec47f181","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"fb80a2782fd3549fdbeba1780923516960856c60a508b13cfdc19cd746fc2c79","logical_entry_identity":"92e4b39ebe5a5b2adf19b81762d2391f55d6a58ac6cb3b77b11905fa737ca1c7","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The Spellblaze Chronicles(2): A Night to Remember","source_tag":"_t","target":"魔法大爆炸纪事(2)：难忘之夜"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"133feee5850fb48d1cefbe5d7275f0539a9518c0587a671e64b919a2b75365c6","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"fb817eecf922f889b58208f1c1736399b82c752873b7f8a7e39037bc79b1ed40","logical_entry_identity":"2142886d23983b85c4cce999bb5e9f8b83bb0bb9a47076edb56d06301b680a15","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The best haul we ever got, gone. We could have been set for life, the most legendary outlaws in all the lands! Villages would tremble at the thought of us roaming the woods.\n\nOnly a matter of time until that nobleman catches wind and comes after us. We were about to get more gold than we could count for his lassie back, and that dirt farmer set her on fire. Of all the skullbrained things to do for fun!\n\nOrdered my men to kill any who pass by and been running triple guard. We need all the time we can get before they come for us, can't let any word out. Once we find somewhere new, I'll leave that idiot burnt on a stake as tribute and hope we don't catch chase. \n\nI'm going to enjoy hearing his screams, a log on the pyre a gold he cost us. Nice and slow, need to make sure he doesn't die easy.","source_tag":"_t","target":"我们费了九牛二虎之力才钓到大鱼，没了！我们本来可以因此扬名立万，成为被整个大陆传颂的不法之徒的传奇，我们的传说会在绿林中传颂，村庄会在我们的面前颤抖，现在全完了！\n\n我们本来只要再等一些时间，让那位贵族听到风声之后过来找我们，就可以从那位大小姐身上榨取一大笔钱，结果那个土老帽村炮居然把她烧死了！这个傻逼还说是为了找乐子！\n\n很好，叫我的人杀掉任何胆敢闯进来的人，守卫的密度增加三倍。我们需要尽可能在他们过来之前抓紧时间，绝对不能泄露任何消息。在我们找到新的藏身地之后，我要把那个蠢货穿在柱子上作为祭品，希望我们不会被他们抓到。\n\n我要好好品尝他的哀嚎，他让我们每损失一枚金币，火堆上就多一根木柴。把这家伙文火慢烤，可别便宜他，让他死的太快了。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b1ef6c086cc8b56d8ab84ca9482ee2073fa0cb6a6cbaa9ac4f5322b59d8075c0","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"fb840df951ff642d0c338bd51c66e28d8f06b8d2cffd09660b467ca3c6cb082d","logical_entry_identity":"39cf6c160bb0f3ba13e0c82aa960224376bfca7ced4c3ac9a63398d5eb0e991c","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Pendant of the Sun and Moons","source_tag":"entity name","target":"日月垂饰"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"30d0f3c62b48d637ccaa96cec4a0eb33d50bd6e4d7467e198555724a6fd1a310","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"fb85190f39e322c17b6e252dff8d94acf911038a88cf252612c2b04829ff2c56","logical_entry_identity":"eba1301541438b826b9db1920526d63743e68d373361c0c385afcd2fee3bee06","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#rng# the Frozen Terror","source_tag":"_t","target":"#rng#冻结恐怖"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"200290f28ac65e928e0fe9eb179f9929655439b3734fc5344717a6589f5d5932","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"fb8811b1bd71ca8bf988d7b346e4c33d0b1e755bd0744b6a8cb1fc9cb485e2dd","logical_entry_identity":"7fab834b5124112cf94b6a062f778bc8d4d479300cba7ab7d3bf3a21c27e4325","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You can not drop %s (plot item).","source_tag":"logPlayer","target":"你不能丢弃%s（剧情物品）。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f13bbaf93a3984e64d081fe3d2a8728367da5d453be3d154aca1446f1b11250c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"fb902a03ef12a9ccefff3f48e44292fbffc42afe44de8d7540ca9a29cc311a47","logical_entry_identity":"3d554c90e9528389ac545b2f5fc24b6fe62842d6422045fd9414a66fca28b502","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Call of the Crypt","source_tag":"talent name","target":"地宫召唤"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"72b6dc72e19fdaf1c585fdd883196f2fa4a416544bd5c2b9f0c12e5426fd90cd","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"fb909181a82d1091d659570d4f03c5a9cb5230011869a5a29dc74586935f73ca","logical_entry_identity":"2ac8e4fc57b76939d11711e4ab985b9b1ab7d2fb6465e3557b7cb01a135924c6","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#GOLD#Confusion resistance:#LIGHT_BLUE# 35%","source_tag":"_t","target":"#GOLD#混乱抗性：#LIGHT_BLUE# 35%"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"81fe95ae30989843bfde417c8df2ca259b75e2621ce66977925fc4a87d43d53c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"fb9166e7e27789afea79a9458d85c01c5a55cdd38eb18b5da0e0529e4dbea61c","logical_entry_identity":"2a9e0ac599c038dc968887a40bee2466d4420d9afa115f8123f4d75c37fae0a1","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Magic has not disappeared from Maj'Eyal with the end of the Spellhunt.\n\nDuring the Age of Dusk, as the Spellhunt was nearing its end, a powerful mage of the Kar'Krul, Linaniil, created a safe haven for the few remaining mages of all races.\nThis place is Angolwen, the City of Magic, and for over two thousands years has taught magic to preserve and expand it.\n\nYou have been told this story and can now create new characters with the #LIGHT_GREEN#Archmage class#WHITE#.\n\nArchmagi are the pinnacle of spellcasters, attuned to the magical properties of the world.\nClass features:#YELLOW#\n- Cast elemental spells to burn your foes to death or freeze them\n- Summon the powers of Space and Time to protect and cripple\n- Dabble in Phantasms and Illusions\n- Manipulate the forces of magic themselves#WHITE#\n\nAll mages use mana to cast their spells.\nIt slowly replenishes over time.\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"魔法狩猎之后魔法并没有从马基·埃亚尔消失。\n\n在黄昏纪元，当魔法狩猎接近尾声时，卡·克鲁尔的一名强大的法师——莱娜尼尔——为剩余的各种族的法师们建立了一个避风港。\n这个地方就是安格利文，魔法之城，在这里，两千多年来一直传授魔法，以保存并发扬它。\n\n现在，你已经知道了这个故事，你可以在创建人物时选择新的职业 #LIGHT_GREEN#元素法师#WHITE#。\n\n元素法师是施法者中的顶峰，与世界的魔法属性相契合。\n职业特点：#YELLOW#\n- 施放元素法术将敌人烧死或冻结\n- 召唤时空的力量保护自己并削弱敌人\n- 涉猎幻术和幻象\n- 操控魔法本身的力量#WHITE#\n\n魔法师使用法力值来释放他们的法术。\n法力值会随着时间缓慢恢复。\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"df763a838d4203b0f8f0f580d37d4f82f452bdaacc124076c8f49d1e9c4e2237","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"fb96572c37d5f2774291b9e0fd56ad657f6f6a7494350e6a40c04af210466224","logical_entry_identity":"71e6abb6dcc842b4a83619dc4d3ca675d7bbfbdfbb48b5b1a6c3d24d64e907ca","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"They asked about the staff and stole it from you.","source_tag":"_t","target":"他们从你那里得知了法杖的消息，把法杖抢走了。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"bd1bb34ed83e631e81f4c52235c003384566ef723bc6c53bed77ccbe40f766f8","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"fb97072da919731e62d3d63bfeec0f8314a96f4a993fe5f1b3f9c57376b23bf6","logical_entry_identity":"5c067673fe3ab5011438f802eaace146c63fdcb7c52ad1fe75e9ec4b6d3fa396","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"corrosive blades","source_tag":"talent type","target":"腐蚀利刃"}],"fixed_source_identity":"commit:624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63","rendered_briefing":"WP2-Lite surface screen; review only","rules_version":"production-review-v2-lite-rules-v2","terminology_snapshot":"66da49fcce23e27b95027c5aa51dc41afc9211cbc227c05fd9cfa8413ec4d2aa"}}}